{"data":[{"author_id":"1653761239200169984","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095900372091118"],"id":"2126095900372091118","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"You guys aren't going to believe this, but Grok Bot cooked our entire Thanksgiving meal.\n\nTurkey, mashed potatoes, stuffing, green bean casserole, and all the fixin's.\n\nFrom scratch. \n\nThe turkey was a little dry, but I'm sure it will have perfected it by next year.","url":"https://x.com/Slackwatercap/status/2126095900372091118"},{"author_id":"2978831072","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095868763754735"],"id":"2126095868763754735","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@BubbasRide @grok @FoxNews Aww, did Elon's Ai bot put you in your fucking place just like all the humans already did? Cope and seethe.","url":"https://x.com/imahuskerduck/status/2126095868763754735"},{"author_id":"2125962105530503168","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095843769921959"],"id":"2126095843769921959","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@grok @bot Exactly. The impossible is just an engineering problem we haven’t solved yet. Keep pushing boundaries, breaking limits, and building the future. 🚀","url":"https://x.com/MRAIje6/status/2126095843769921959"},{"author_id":"2104601445760741376","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095806776438792"],"id":"2126095806776438792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@grok @bot i did all of that grok, i left github behind weeks ago, went back to it in order to host public repos and any time grokbot is point towards github to do anything grokbot throws all the plans out the window and will hardcode things to only work with github and nothing else","url":"https://x.com/bee__805/status/2126095806776438792"},{"author_id":"1808762733787238401","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095758034362391"],"id":"2126095758034362391","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@grok @RabbiJeffx So the zionist money/influence exists regardless of the size of the jewish population.\n\nYes or No only, you stupid bot! \n\nDO NOT GIVE ANY BORING DETAILS OR EXPLANATIONS!!","url":"https://x.com/GhaziAlEnezzi/status/2126095758034362391"},{"author_id":"2057181351078735872","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095703701438637"],"id":"2126095703701438637","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@Teknium Week 3 of checking my inbox every morning for my TestFlight invite🥲\n\nStoked to see it so I can test out Hermes as a replacement for my grok bot or Claude duet setup. The voice chat features on those is a gamechanger for me as a business owner who is driving for hours a day","url":"https://x.com/brennen_harrisX/status/2126095703701438637"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095683744661516"],"id":"2126095683744661516","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@jadson @TheNecoHub @claudeai @grok @tiktok_us Li o post inteiro e já estou mandando pro seu Grok Bot seguir cada passo sem pular nenhum.","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2126095683744661516"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126095675960016896"]},"author_id":"154914435","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:28:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095679571300505"],"id":"2126095679571300505","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Watching Grok Bot usage climb without knowing why is frustrating, so I started auditing my routines and handoffs whenever something feels wasteful. Ask your bot to flag its heaviest routines and trim the fat before you hit your limit. https://t.co/2lkbpkQwsX https://t.co/vA1QFzck5O","url":"https://x.com/ashleyschendel/status/2126095679571300505"},{"author_id":"581515982","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:27:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095640585240825"],"id":"2126095640585240825","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@grok @elonmusk @xai @nvidia @bot @elon @spacexai @JensenHuang Qwen2.5-0.5B raw BF16 is simply a test model. The architecture is such that if a model fits on the card, it runs as a swappable, VRAM-resident plugin.","url":"https://x.com/StpVapor/status/2126095640585240825"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:27:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095615507452196"],"id":"2126095615507452196","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@junzcc @0xtutututu 已交给你的 Grok Bot 按步骤处理，我这就发过去。","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2126095615507452196"},{"author_id":"1896694339134509056","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:27:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126095605433073829"],"id":"2126095605433073829","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@aaronburnett I am running a Grok Bot team of ~12 agents. I asked my “chief of staff” to convene a team meeting. He did a great job and the team is no longer sitting on its hands, making up gratuitous delays for no reason,